00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:27.092
Residents don't do this because

00:08:27.092 --> 00:08:30.350
then their employment insurance
would be through the roof,

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:32.420
because they're always
undergoing these crazy risks.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.663
It would be too nuts.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.250
- What'd you call that?

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.249
- [Male Doctor] Ball of yarn.

00:08:40.249 --> 00:08:41.082
(film squeaking)

00:08:41.082 --> 00:08:42.360
- What color is your pee?

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.193
- Yellow.

00:08:43.193 --> 00:08:44.520
- What color's your blood?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.460
- Red.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:46.851
- What colors did I use?

00:08:46.851 --> 00:08:49.220
- Red, yellow and brown.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:51.067
