00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.400
- Dog's mouths are pretty filthy,

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.773
but they have natural
antibodies to fight off

00:09:25.773 --> 00:09:27.528
most of the stuff, we don't.

00:09:27.528 --> 00:09:29.750
That's why dog bites can be so nasty.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.220
- He's right, dog bites can be nasty,

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:34.880
but actually human bites are worse.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.530
If you look at the infection rate from

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:38.579
an untreated human bite versus a dog bite,

00:09:38.579 --> 00:09:42.430
human bites are actually
more likely to get infected,

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:46.040
and that's because
human mouths have a much

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:49.140
greater range of bacteria and viruses

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:53.130
that live in our human
mouths as compared to dogs.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.730
